# FORLORN HOPE: the rest of the foes do their things: a comb sends midges, a
# hornet bell hornets, a hatcheteer throws axes, a rust knight slashes, a
# drake breathes a fan of shot, a bloater lets out rings, a broodhen shoots
# one at a time, a hornhead leaps, a stingback throws oozles, a squawker hops
# about but stays near home.
game forlorn
cheat start 1
wait 20
